    par Audio Thread - hardware-driven loop (audio_driver_wasapi.cpp / audio_driver_alsa.cpp)  
        loop until exit_thread  
            AT->>AT: lock() - acquire AudioDriver BinaryMutex  
            AT->>AT: audio_server_process() calls AudioServer::_driver_process()  
            AT->>AT: unlock() - release mutex  
            AT->>AT: wait for hardware buffer event (OS-level block)  
        end  
    and Render Thread - pump task loop (rendering_server_default.cpp:397)  
        loop until exit  
            RT->>WTP: yield() - suspend pump task  
            WTP-->>RT: notify_yield_over() when CommandQueueMT has pending commands  
            RT->>RT: command_queue.flush_all() - execute all queued render commands  
        end  
    and Physics 3D Thread - pump task loop (physics_server_3d_wrap_mt.cpp:50)  
        loop until exit  
            P3D->>WTP: yield() - suspend pump task  
            WTP-->>P3D: notify_yield_over() when command pending  
            P3D->>P3D: if not doing_sync: command_queue.flush_all()  
        end  
    and Physics 2D Thread - pump task loop (physics_server_2d_wrap_mt.cpp:50)  
        loop until exit  
            P2D->>WTP: yield() - suspend pump task  
            WTP-->>P2D: notify_yield_over() when command pending  
            P2D->>P2D: if not doing_sync: command_queue.flush_all()  
        end  
    and Wayland Event Thread - fd-driven loop (wayland_thread.cpp:3025)  
        loop until thread_done  
            WayEvt->>WayEvt: wl_display_prepare_read() - claim read slot  
            WayEvt->>WayEvt: acquire thread_data.mutex  
            WayEvt->>WayEvt: wl_display_dispatch_pending() - dispatch queued events  
            WayEvt->>WayEvt: release thread_data.mutex  
            WayEvt->>WayEvt: wl_display_flush() - flush outgoing requests  
            WayEvt->>WayEvt: poll(wl_fd -1) - BLOCKS indefinitely waiting for compositor data  
            WayEvt->>WayEvt: wl_display_read_events() - load new events into queue  
            WayEvt->>WayEvt: acquire thread_data.mutex  
            WayEvt->>WayEvt: wl_display_dispatch_pending() - dispatch newly read events  
            Note over WayEvt: Event callbacks call push_message() to queue messages for Main  
            WayEvt->>WayEvt: release thread_data.mutex  
        end  
    and X11 Event Thread - polling loop (display_server_x11.cpp:4571)  
        loop until events_thread_done  
            X11Evt->>X11Evt: _wait_for_events(0 1000) - select() with 1ms timeout on X11 fd  
            X11Evt->>X11Evt: acquire events_mutex  
            X11Evt->>X11Evt: _check_pending_events(polled_events) - drain X11 queue into vector  
            X11Evt->>X11Evt: release events_mutex  
        end  
    and Debugger TCP Thread - rate-limited loop (remote_debugger_peer.cpp:203)  
        loop while running and peer connected  
            DbgTCP->>DbgTCP: tcp_client->poll() - update TCP state  
            DbgTCP->>DbgTCP: _write_out() - flush out_queue to socket under mutex  
            DbgTCP->>DbgTCP: _read_in() - read socket into in_queue under mutex  
            DbgTCP->>DbgTCP: sleep to maintain ~144Hz rate (min_tick=6900us)  
        end  
    and IP DNS Resolver Thread - semaphore-driven loop (ip.cpp:117)  
        loop until thread_abort  
            IPRes->>IPRes: sem.wait() - BLOCKS until resolve request posted  
            IPRes->>IPRes: resolve_queues() - call getaddrinfo() for each pending item  
            Note over IPRes: Results stored in queue_list under mutex - caller polls status  
        end  
    and DBus Portal Monitor Thread - polling loop (freedesktop_portal_desktop.cpp:855)  
        loop until monitor_thread_abort  
            DBusMon->>DBusMon: dbus_connection_pop_message() - drain DBus message queue  
            DBusMon->>DBusMon: handle SettingChanged signals - call_deferred theme change  
            DBusMon->>DBusMon: handle portal Response signals - push to pending_file_cbs under mutex  
            DBusMon->>DBusMon: dbus_connection_read_write() - flush DBus connection  
            DBusMon->>DBusMon: delay_usec(50000) - sleep 50ms  
        end  
    and AT-SPI Monitor Thread - polling loop (freedesktop_at_spi_monitor.cpp:52)  
        loop until exit_thread  
            AtSPI->>AtSPI: dbus_connection_send_with_reply_and_block() - query IsEnabled (50ms timeout)  
            AtSPI->>AtSPI: set/clear ac_enabled atomic flag  
            AtSPI->>AtSPI: dbus_connection_send_with_reply_and_block() - query ScreenReaderEnabled  
            AtSPI->>AtSPI: set/clear sr_enabled atomic flag  
            AtSPI->>AtSPI: usleep(50000) - sleep 50ms  
        end  
    and ALSA MIDI Thread - polling loop (midi_driver_alsamidi.cpp:69)  
        loop until exit_thread  
            MIDI->>MIDI: lock() - acquire MIDI mutex  
            MIDI->>MIDI: conn.read() for each connected ALSA rawmidi input  
            MIDI->>MIDI: unlock() - release mutex  
            MIDI->>MIDI: delay_usec(1000) - sleep 1ms  
        end  
    end  
  
